cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Trust-Aware Query Optimization for AI-Native Data
  Systems (reference implementation)
message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, please cite
  both the software and the accompanying paper.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jorge
    family-names: Martinez-Gil
    email: jorge.martinez-gil@scch.at
    affiliation: Software Competence Center Hagenberg GmbH (SCCH), Austria
repository-code: "https://github.com/jorge-martinez-gil/trust-aware"
url: "https://github.com/jorge-martinez-gil/trust-aware"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-light reference implementation of trust-aware query
  optimization for AI-native data systems, including constraint-aware
  source selection, calibrated beta-binomial trust scoring, explainable
  query plans, trust certificates, redundant source portfolios,
  multi-stage pipeline planning, and a real-data federated retrieval
  study over five public-domain IR collections.
keywords:
  - query-optimization
  - trust
  - ai-native-data-systems
  - provenance
  - retrieval-augmented-generation
  - federated-information-retrieval
